  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/spoorn/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &amp;message=其他專案&amp;color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label= &amp;message=other projects&amp;color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"170\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/xfddZwG898\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/990178919795785749?color=4b5966&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/990178919795785749?color=4b5966&amp;label= &amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornExtras\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=github &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=github &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/spoorn/SpoornExtras/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=問題 &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues-raw/spoorn/SpoornExtras?color=4b5966&amp;labelColor=658f79&amp;label=issues &amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"120\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">平滑地踏上方塊，而非自動跳躍。簡單且快速的模組。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">客戶端模組</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">這基本上與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stepup\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stepup</a>&nbsp;的功能相同，但現在適用於更新的 Minecraft 版本（1.18+），然而程式碼完全不同，並且我們使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config 配置</a> 來切換踏上功能，而非使用按鍵綁定。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:left\">配置</h2><p>配置檔案位於您的 Minecraft 遊戲資料夾中的 config/stepitup.json5。您可以啟用/停用踏上功能，並在潛行時啟用/停用它（需要重新啟動遊戲才能生效）。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>建議使用某種 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>，這樣您應該能夠透過該模組選單動態配置，而無需重新啟動遊戲。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>需要伺服器嗎？</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fspoorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KPURPK0.png\" alt=\"https://bisecthosting.com/spoorn\" width=\"1000\" height=\"158\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>致謝</h3><p>所有程式碼由 spoorn 製作</p><p>CurseForge 模組圖標由&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dimaalf/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">DIMaalF</a> 提供</p>",
